      "specialties_text": "Premium Hair • Beauty • Makeup • Grooming",
      "paragraph_1": "At Blink Unisex Salon & Academy, we believe great style is more than just a look — it is about confidence.",
      "paragraph_2": "We offer a wide range of professional hair, beauty, grooming and makeup services for women, men and children. Our goal is to provide quality services, personalised attention and a comfortable salon experience at an affordable price.",
